algorithms.pseudocode:
Algorithm: NatCheckDivisible(a, b)
if a = 0: return (b = 0)
else: return (b mod a = 0)
Time: O(log(max(a,b)))

Algorithm: NatCheckExistsUpTo(N, p)
for n = 0 to N: if p(n) return (True, n)
return (False, None)
Time: O(N * T_p)

Soundness: result = True <=> proposition holds (both directions proved)
